_breakfast_-_Flickr_-_love.jsc.jpg/500px-Nutella_for_breakfast_-_Flickr_-_love.jsc.jpg","w":500,"h":335,"by":"Janine from South Korea, United States","lic":"CC BY 2.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nutella_for_breakfast_-_Flickr_-_love.jsc.jpg"}},"dish/lorne-sausage":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/lorne-sausage","n":"Lorne sausage","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Scottish cuisine","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["The Lorne sausage, also known as square sausage or slice sausage, is a traditional Scottish food item made from minced meat, rusk and spices. Although termed a sausage, no casing is used to hold the meat in shape, hence it is usually served as square slices from a formed block. It is a common component of the traditional Scottish breakfast."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-lorne-sausage"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lorne_sausage"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Scottish cuisine","cuisine/scottish-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":2,"links":[["Ground meat","ingredient/ground-meat"],["Zwieback","ingredient/zwieback"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Scottish Scran","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"scottishscran.com","note":"Blog working through traditional Scottish dishes one recipe at a time.","url":"https://scottishscran.com","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"Something Sweet Something Savoury: Scottish recipes","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"somethingsweetsomethingsavoury.com","note":"Scottish home baking and cooking section of a UK food blog.","url":"https://somethingsweetsomethingsavoury.com/category/scottish-recipes/","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Scottish cuisine","links":[["Clootie dumpling","dish/clootie-dumpling"],["Cock-a-leekie","dish/cock-a-leekie"],["Finnan haddie","dish/finnan-haddie"],["Haggis","dish/haggis"],["Haggis pakora","dish/haggis-pako